[l_braz_por]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=Infiltrar o exército
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=O exército [From.GetAdjective] tem um número de indivíduos entre seus soldados que podem mudar de lado para fornecer informações adicionais e apoiar operações futuras.

[l_english]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=Infiltrate Army
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=§LThe [From.GetAdjective] Army has a number of individuals in its ranks that could be turned to provide additional information and support for future operations.§!

[l_french]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=Infiltrer l'armée de terre
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=§LL'armée [From.GetAdjFS] compte un certain nombre de membres qui pourraient être retournés afin qu'ils livrent des informations et du soutien pour les opérations futures.§!

[l_german]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=Armee infiltrieren
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=§LDie [From.GetAdjective]e Armee hat einige Personen in ihren Reihen, die man umdrehen könnte, um an Informationen zu kommen und zukünftige Operationen zu erleichtern.§!

[l_japanese]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=陸軍への潜入
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=§L[From.GetAdjective]陸軍は、追加の情報を提供し、将来の作戦支援に便利な人員を多く抱えている。§!

[l_korean]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=육군에 잠입
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=§L[From.GetAdjective]군 구성원 중에는 우리 쪽으로 전향시켜 향후 작전에 대한 추가 정보와 지원을 제공해 줄 만한 인물이 여럿 있습니다.§!

[l_polish]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=Przeniknięcie do armii
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=W armii [From.GetAdjective] służą ludzie, których moglibyśmy pozyskać, dzięki czemu zdobywalibyśmy dodatkowe informacje i pomoc w przyszłych operacjach.

[l_russian]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=Внедрение в армию
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=§LВ [From.GetAdjective]ой армии есть люди, которых можно склонить к передаче нам дополнительной информации и поддержке в будущих операциях.§!

[l_simp_chinese]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=渗透陆军
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=§L[From.GetAdjective]陆军中有许多马员可以倒向我方，为未来的行动提供更多信息和支持。§!

[l_spanish]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army=Infiltrarse en el ejército
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_army_desc=El ejército [From.GetAdjective] tiene varios individuos en sus filas a los que podríamos convertir para que nos faciliten información y apoyo en futuras operaciones.
